# craft-a-server release-signing public keys (minisign).
#
# One key per line (the second line of a `.pub` file written by `minisign -G`).
# A release is accepted when ANY listed key verifies it; list at most two keys,
# the current one and, during a rotation, the next one (docs/releasing.md).
#
# This file is the single source of truth. It is compiled into the
# `craft-a-server` CLI (crates/craft-a-server-cli/src/update/keys.rs) and
# copied verbatim into deploy/install.sh; a test fails if the copies differ.
#
